        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S30003AT, Stainless Steel Athena Lever with Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Athena Lever with Square Rose is modern, with an attention to sleek, sharp design trends that are so popular among designers and homeowners alike. The Stainless Steel Athena Lever with Square Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The Contemporary Athena Door Leverset with Square Rosette has a brushed stainless steel finish that is durable. It resists scratches and finger prints and is easy to care for. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Athena Door Leverset with Square Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid stainless steel lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Athena Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.73\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Square: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-S30003AT-specifications.gif?v=1704354721\" width=\"266\" height=\"196\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek S30003AT Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Athena Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Athena Lever with Square Rose is modern, with an attention to sleek, sharp design trends that are so popular among designers and homeowners alike. The Stainless Steel Athena Lever with Square Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/8 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. The Contemporary Athena Door Leverset with Square Rosette has a brushed stainless steel finish that is durable. It resists scratches and finger prints and is easy to care for. \r\n",
